<title>CHILE: Jaime Perry appointed Santa Isabel CEO.</title>
<headline>Jaime Perry appointed Santa Isabel CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Supermarket chain Santa Isabel has appointed finance manager Jaime Perry as CEO, replacing the company's founder Eduardo Elberg who has stepped down from the position, said the firm.</p>
<p>Elberg will remain company president and chairman of the board, said the statement.</p>
<p>Jose Ferrer will replace Perry as finance manager.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
